---
layout: layouts/main.pug
---

include ../mixins/topics.pug

article
  h1= title
  if date
    p.text-secondary.mb-2
      time(datetime=new Date(date).toISOString())
        | #{new Date(date).toLocaleDateString('en-US', { dateStyle: 'long', timeZone: 'UTC' })}
  +topicLinks(tags, topics)
  //- Provenance. Renders only for articles that declare a `source`, so the
  //- pages that don't claim rules authority are untouched. A test requires
  //- `verified` alongside `source` and fails once it goes stale.
  if source
    p.small.text-secondary.border-start.border-3.ps-3.py-1
      if ruleYear
        | Reflects the #{ruleYear} NFHS rules year.
      |  Built from #{source}.
      if verified
        |  Last checked #{new Date(verified).toLocaleDateString('en-US', { dateStyle: 'long', timeZone: 'UTC' })}.
      br
      if ruleYear
        | Verify against the current rule book and VPA guide before teaching this as authoritative.
      else
        | Dues, fees and association practice change. Confirm with the association before relying on this.
  | !{content}
